---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Button from '../../components/Button.astro';
import Card from '../../components/Card.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Read & reflect"
  description="Weekly Swedenborg reading and exploration — Wednesdays 10am to noon, in person and Zoom."
  currentPath="/events"
>
  <main class="container-prose px-6 md:px-8 pt-10 md:pt-14 pb-4">
    <p class="mb-4">
      <a
        href="/events"
        class="font-display text-sm font-semibold text-accent-primary no-underline hover:underline"
        >← Events</a
      >
    </p>

    <article class="prose-rnc">
      <div
        class="font-display font-semibold text-eyebrow tracking-eyebrow uppercase text-accent-primary mb-2.5 !mt-0"
      >
        ✦ Wednesdays · 10am–noon
      </div>
      <h1>Join our Weekly Swedenborg Reading and Exploration Sessions</h1>
      <p>
        <strong>Wednesdays – 10 am to noon – In person and Zoom</strong><br />
        Hosted by the Swedenborg Centre, 4 Shirley Rd, Roseville
      </p>
      <p>
        You're warmly invited to join our weekly Swedenborg reading and
        exploration on Wednesdays. Together we read and discuss passages from
        Emanuel Swedenborg's writings, taking time to reflect on their spiritual
        meaning and how they can enrich our understanding of everyday life.
        Whether you are new to Swedenborg or have been reading his works for
        many years, you are very welcome.
      </p>
      <p>
        We are currently exploring <em>True Christianity</em> (also published as
        <em>True Christian Religion</em>), Swedenborg's comprehensive
        presentation of his central theological teachings. Each session focuses
        on a small section of the text, with plenty of opportunity for
        questions, discussion, and sharing insights.
      </p>
      <p>
        There's no need to have attended previous sessions. We begin each week
        with a brief overview of the context, making it easy to join at any
        point in the series.
      </p>
      <p>
        Come along with curiosity, bring your questions, and enjoy exploring
        these profound ideas in a friendly and welcoming group.
      </p>
    </article>

    <Card variant="tint" class="mt-8" title="Zoom link and dates">
      <p class="m-0">
        The Zoom link and dates can be found on the Swedenborg Centre events
        page.
      </p>
      <div slot="footer">
        <Button href="https://swedenborg.com.au/events/">
          swedenborg.com.au/events →
        </Button>
      </div>
    </Card>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
